## 2. Starting OpenAlgo (broker bridge, ports 5000 + 8765)

```powershell
$env:APP_MODE = "standalone"   # stops app.py from double-starting the WS proxy
Start-Process cmd -ArgumentList "/c start /B C:\Users\Admin\CodeGPT\my-trading-system\.venv\Scripts\python.exe C:\Users\Admin\CodeGPT\my-trading-system\scripts\start_openalgo.py --no-scrub-on-exit"
```

- Do NOT run `gunicorn` on Windows (needs fcntl). The launcher uses Werkzeug with `allow_unsafe_werkzeug=True`.
- `_restored\.env` + `_restored\db\` are cryptographically married (FERNET_SALT + API_KEY_PEPPER encrypt the broker tokens in `openalgo.db`). Restore/keep them together.
- Verify: `http://127.0.0.1:5000/` returns 200; WS `ws://127.0.0.1:8765` accepts a handshake.

